                                "sense_id": "ee40a989-5183-327b-9127-f308b271adf3",
                                "text": "The fans, or brushes, create currents in the water that direct food toward the larvae’s mouthparts and help stuff the food into their deeply concealed mouths."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
